# The compiled enrollment launcher is committed on purpose, against the usual
# rule about binaries in git.
#
# Render builds on Linux and has no csc.exe, so this artifact can never be
# produced at deploy time — if it is not in the repo, the control plane has
# nothing to serve and the download button on /enroll simply does not exist.
# Committing it is what makes the feature real in production.
#
# It is 28 KB, reproducible from installer/SentinelSetup.cs with
# installer/build.ps1, and unsigned — see installer/README.md for the
# SmartScreen consequences. A negation cannot reach inside an ignored
# directory, so the directory is unignored first and everything else in it
# re-ignored below.
!installer/dist/
installer/dist/*
!installer/dist/SentinelSetup.exe
